{"script":"sj_002_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]可别小看了我生存专家米托拉。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]长年荒野生存，我的适应力可是很强的！不管什么样的环境，最多两三天我就可以过得像是家里一样惬意！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿。虽然……我也还没有想起自己的故乡在哪……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2l","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不过我有种预感！跟你一起冒险下去的话，一定可以找到更多跟我记忆相关的线索。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]虽然我也说不清这种预感是哪来的……但是，这种感觉十分强烈。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]而且，自从跟你结伴之后，我的生活可变得轻松太多了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]睡床松软了很多，营地的空间安排也好了很多。最重要的是，你来了之后，饭菜也可口了好多！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]要是习惯了这样的生活，要让我再过回以前的生活可就费劲咯。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你可要负起责任，在我只靠自己也能过上这样的生活前……不，在我比你能做的更好之前，一直让我跟你一起旅行啊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不是我吹牛，这种东西我学得可是很慢的！做好觉悟吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"米托拉-习惯现在的生活了吗？"}